#. type: Attribute 'xreflabel' of: <sect1>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:15
#, xml-text
msgid "Introduction to KF5"
msgstr "Introdução ao &quot;KF5&quot;"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><title>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:19
#, xml-text
msgid "KDE Frameworks 5 Pre-installation Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração da Pré-instalação do Frameworks 5 do KDE"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:22
#, xml-text
msgid "KDE Frameworks Introduction"
msgstr "Introdução ao Frameworks do KDE"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:26
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"KF5 can be installed in <filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename> or "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/opt/kf5</filename>. The BLFS editors "
"recommend the latter in the BLFS environment."
msgstr ""
"O &quot;KF5&quot; pode ser instalado em &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>&quot; ou &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">/opt/kf5</filename>&quot;. Os(As) editores(as) do BLFS "
"recomendam o último no ambiente do BLFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:32
#, xml-text
msgid "Installing in /usr"
msgstr "Instalando in /usr"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:35
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"One option is to install <application>KDE Frameworks 5</application> into "
"the <filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename> hierarchy.  This creates a"
" simpler setup but makes it more difficult to try multiple versions of "
"<application>KDE Frameworks</application>."
msgstr ""
"Uma opção é a de instalar o &quot;<application>KDE Frameworks "
"5</application>&quot; na hierarquia &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>&quot;. Isso cria uma configuração mais "
"simples, mas torna mais difícil testar múltiplas versões do "
"&quot;<application>KDE Frameworks</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:41
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>export KF5_PREFIX=/usr</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>export KF5_PREFIX=/usr</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:44
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"It is a good idea to add the following variables to your system or personal "
"profiles:"
msgstr ""
"É uma boa ideia adicionar as seguintes variáveis aos teus perfis de sistema "
"ou pessoal:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:48
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin kf5 extension for /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh\n"
"\n"
"pathappend /usr/lib/plugins        QT_PLUGIN_PATH\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/lib/plugins     QT_PLUGIN_PATH\n"
"\n"
"pathappend /usr/lib/qt5/qml        QML2_IMPORT_PATH\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/lib/qml         QML2_IMPORT_PATH\n"
"\n"
"# End extension for /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/kf5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/profile.d/kf5.sh\n"
"\n"
"export KF5_PREFIX=/usr\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/profile.d/kf5.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Inicia extensão do kf5 para /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh\n"
"\n"
"pathappend /usr/lib/plugins        QT_PLUGIN_PATH\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/lib/plugins     QT_PLUGIN_PATH\n"
"\n"
"pathappend /usr/lib/qt5/qml        QML2_IMPORT_PATH\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/lib/qml         QML2_IMPORT_PATH\n"
"\n"
"# Termina extensão para /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/kf5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Inicia /etc/profile.d/kf5.sh\n"
"\n"
"export KF5_PREFIX=/usr\n"
"\n"
"# Termina /etc/profile.d/kf5.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:70
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <application>qt5</application> was installed in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, the <filename "
"class=\"directory\">$QT5DIR/lib/</filename> portions of the above paths may "
"need to be changed to <filename "
"class=\"directory\">$QT5DIR/lib/qt5/</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Se o &quot;<application>qt5</application>&quot; foi instalado em "
"&quot;<filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>&quot;, [então] as partes"
" &quot;<filename class=\"directory\">$QT5DIR/lib/</filename>&quot; dos "
"caminhos acima podem precisar serem mudadas para &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">$QT5DIR/lib/qt5/</filename>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:79
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Additionally, if <xref linkend=\"sudo\"/> is installed, these variables "
"should be available to the super user. Execute the following commands as the"
" <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Adicionalmente, se <xref linkend=\"sudo\"/> estiver instalado, essas "
"variáveis deveriam estar disponíveis para o(a) superusuário(a). Execute os "
"seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:84
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/sudoers.d/qt &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>Defaults env_keep += QT_PLUGIN_PATH\n"
"Defaults env_keep += QML2_IMPORT_PATH</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt;&gt; /etc/sudoers.d/kde &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>Defaults env_keep += KF5_PREFIX</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/sudoers.d/qt &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>Defaults env_keep += QT_PLUGIN_PATH\n"
"Defaults env_keep += QML2_IMPORT_PATH</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt;&gt; /etc/sudoers.d/kde &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>Defaults env_keep += KF5_PREFIX</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:96
#, xml-text
msgid "Installing in /opt"
msgstr "Instalando em /opt"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:99
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"A method of building multiple versions installs <application>KDE Frameworks "
"5</application> in the <filename class=\"directory\">/opt</filename> "
"hierarchy:"
msgstr ""
"Um método de construção de múltiplas versões instala o "
"&quot;<application>KDE Frameworks 5</application>&quot; na hierarquia "
"&quot;<filename class=\"directory\">/opt</filename>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:104
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>export KF5_PREFIX=/opt/kf5</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>export KF5_PREFIX=/opt/kf5</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:107
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you are not installing <application>KDE Frameworks 5</application> in "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, you will need to make some "
"additional configuration changes. Best practice is to add those to your "
"system or personal profile:"
msgstr ""
"Se você não estiver instalando o &quot;<application>KDE Frameworks "
"5</application>&quot; em &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>&quot;, [então] você precisará fazer "
"algumas mudanças adicionais de configuração. A melhor prática é a de "
"adicioná-los ao teu perfil de sistema ou pessoal:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:113
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/kf5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/profile.d/kf5.sh\n"
"\n"
"export KF5_PREFIX=/opt/kf5\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/bin              PATH\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/lib/pkgconfig    PKG_CONFIG_PATH\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/etc/xdg          XDG_CONFIG_DIRS\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/share            XDG_DATA_DIRS\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/lib/plugins      QT_PLUGIN_PATH\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/lib/plugins/kcms QT_PLUGIN_PATH\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/lib/qml          QML2_IMPORT_PATH\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/lib/python&python3-majorver;/site-packages PYTHONPATH\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/share/man        MANPATH\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/include          CPLUS_INCLUDE_PATH\n"
"# End /etc/profile.d/kf5.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt;&gt; /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin Qt5 changes for KF5\n"
"\n"
"pathappend /usr/lib/plugins            QT_PLUGIN_PATH\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/plugins             QT_PLUGIN_PATH\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/qml                 QML2_IMPORT_PATH\n"
"\n"
"# End Qt5 changes for KF5</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/profile.d/kf5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Inicia /etc/profile.d/kf5.sh\n"
"\n"
"export KF5_PREFIX=/opt/kf5\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/bin              PATH\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/lib/pkgconfig    PKG_CONFIG_PATH\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/etc/xdg          XDG_CONFIG_DIRS\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/share            XDG_DATA_DIRS\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/lib/plugins      QT_PLUGIN_PATH\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/lib/plugins/kcms QT_PLUGIN_PATH\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/lib/qml          QML2_IMPORT_PATH\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/lib/python&python3-majorver;/site-packages PYTHONPATH\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/share/man        MANPATH\n"
"\n"
"pathappend $KF5_PREFIX/include          CPLUS_INCLUDE_PATH\n"
"# Termina /etc/profile.d/kf5.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt;&gt; /etc/profile.d/qt5.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Inicia mudanças Qt5 para KF5\n"
"\n"
"pathappend /usr/lib/plugins            QT_PLUGIN_PATH\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/plugins             QT_PLUGIN_PATH\n"
"pathappend $QT5DIR/qml                 QML2_IMPORT_PATH\n"
"\n"
"# Termina mudanças Qt5 para KF5</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid "Expand your <filename>/etc/ld.so.conf</filename> file:"
msgstr "Expanda teu arquivo <filename>/etc/ld.so.conf</filename>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:151
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/ld.so.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin KF5 addition\n"
"\n"
"/opt/kf5/lib\n"
"\n"
"# End KF5 addition</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/ld.so.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Inicia adição do KF5\n"
"\n"
"/opt/kf5/lib\n"
"\n"
"# Termina adição do KF5</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:160
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/ld.so.conf"
msgstr "/etc/ld.so.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Several <application>KDE Frameworks 5</application> and <application>Plasma "
"5</application> packages install files into <application>D-Bus</application>"
" and <application>Polkit</application> directories. When installing "
"<application>KDE Frameworks 5</application> in a location other than "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, "
"<application>D-Bus</application> and <application>Polkit</application> need "
"to be able to find these files.  The easiest way to achieve this is to "
"create the following symlinks (as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user):"
msgstr ""
"Vários pacotes &quot;<application>KDE Frameworks 5</application>&quot; e "
"&quot;<application>Plasma 5</application>&quot; instalam arquivos nos "
"diretórios do &quot;<application>D-Bus</application>&quot; e do "
"&quot;<application>Polkit</application>&quot;. Ao instalar o "
"&quot;<application>KDE Frameworks 5</application>&quot; em um local "
"diferente de &quot;<filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>&quot;, o "
"&quot;<application>D-Bus</application>&quot; e o "
"&quot;<application>Polkit</application>&quot; precisam ser capazes de "
"encontrar esses arquivos. A maneira mais fácil de conseguir isso é a de "
"criar os seguintes links simbólicos (como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:177
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755           $KF5_PREFIX/{etc,share} &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /etc/dbus-1         $KF5_PREFIX/etc         &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /usr/share/dbus-1   $KF5_PREFIX/share       &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /usr/share/polkit-1 $KF5_PREFIX/share</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755            $KF5_PREFIX/{etc,share} &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /etc/dbus-1         $KF5_PREFIX/etc         &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /usr/share/dbus-1   $KF5_PREFIX/share       &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /usr/share/polkit-1 $KF5_PREFIX/share</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:183
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Several <application>KDE Frameworks 5</application> and <application>KDE "
"Plasma 5</application> packages install files into "
"<application>D-Bus</application>, <application>Polkit</application>, and "
"<application>systemd</application> directories. When installing "
"<application>KDE 5</application> in a location other than <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>, <application>D-Bus</application>, "
"<application>Polkit</application>, and <application>systemd</application> "
"need to be able to find these files.  The easiest way to achieve this is to "
"create the following symlinks (as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user):"
msgstr ""
"Vários pacotes &quot;<application>KDE Frameworks 5</application>&quot; e "
"&quot;<application>KDE Plasma 5</application>&quot; instalam arquivos nos "
"diretórios do &quot;<application>D-Bus</application>&quot;, do "
"&quot;<application>Polkit</application>&quot; e do "
"&quot;<application>systemd</application>&quot;. Ao instalar o "
"&quot;<application>KDE 5</application>&quot; em um local diferente de "
"&quot;<filename class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>&quot;, o "
"&quot;<application>D-Bus</application>&quot;, o "
"&quot;<application>Polkit</application>&quot; e o "
"&quot;<application>systemd</application>&quot; precisam ser capazes de "
"encontrar esses arquivos. A maneira mais fácil de conseguir isso é a de "
"criar os seguintes links simbólicos (como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:198
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755           $KF5_PREFIX/{etc,share} &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /etc/dbus-1         $KF5_PREFIX/etc         &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /usr/share/dbus-1   $KF5_PREFIX/share       &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /usr/share/polkit-1 $KF5_PREFIX/share       &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -dm755           $KF5_PREFIX/lib         &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /usr/lib/systemd    $KF5_PREFIX/lib</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755            $KF5_PREFIX/{etc,share} &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /etc/dbus-1         $KF5_PREFIX/etc         &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /usr/share/dbus-1   $KF5_PREFIX/share       &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /usr/share/polkit-1 $KF5_PREFIX/share       &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -dm755           $KF5_PREFIX/lib         &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /usr/lib/systemd    $KF5_PREFIX/lib</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:206
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Some packages may also install icons from the \"hicolor\" icon set. Since "
"that icon set is used by many packages, it is a good idea to create a "
"symlink to the one in <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/share</filename> to"
" avoid having multiple installations of <xref linkend=\"hicolor-icon-"
"theme\"/>.  Run the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Alguns pacotes também possivelmente instalem ícones provenientes do conjunto"
" de ícones \"hicolor\". Como esse conjunto de ícones é usado por muitos "
"pacotes, é uma boa ideia criar um link simbólico para aquele em <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/share</filename>, para se evitar ter múltiplas "
"instalações de <xref linkend=\"hicolor-icon-theme\"/>. Execute os seguintes "
"comandos como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:214
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755                $KF5_PREFIX/share/icons &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /usr/share/icons/hicolor $KF5_PREFIX/share/icons</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755                 $KF5_PREFIX/share/icons &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /usr/share/icons/hicolor $KF5_PREFIX/share/icons</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><tip><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:219
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Sometimes, the installation paths are hardcoded into installed files.  This "
"is the reason why <filename class=\"directory\">/opt/kf5</filename> is used "
"as installation prefix instead of <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/opt/kf5-&kf5-version;</filename>. After installing "
"<application>KDE Frameworks</application>, you may rename the directory and "
"create a symlink:"
msgstr ""
"Ocasionalmente, os caminhos de instalação são rigidamente codificados em "
"arquivos instalados. Essa é a razão pela qual &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">/opt/kf5</filename>&quot; é usado como prefixo de "
"instalação em vez de &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">/opt/kf5-&kf5-version;</filename>&quot;. Depois de "
"instalar o &quot;<application>KDE Frameworks</application>&quot;, você pode "
"renomear o diretório e criar um link simbólico:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><tip><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:227
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mv /opt/kf5{,-&kf5-version;}\n"
"ln -sfv kf5-&kf5-version; /opt/kf5</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mv /opt/kf5{,-&kf5-version;}\n"
"ln -sfv kf5-&kf5-version; /opt/kf5</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><tip><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-intro.xml:231
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Later on, you may want to install other versions of <application>KDE "
"Frameworks 5</application>. To do that, just remove the symlink and use "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/opt/kf5</filename> as the prefix again. Which"
" version of <application>KDE Frameworks 5</application> you use depends only"
" on where the symlink points. No other reconfiguration will be needed."
msgstr ""
"Mais tarde, você possivelmente queira instalar outras versões do "
"&quot;<application>KDE Frameworks 5</application>&quot;. Para fazer isso, "
"basta remover o link simbólico e usar &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">/opt/kf5</filename>&quot; como prefixo novamente. Qual "
"versão do &quot;<application>KDE Frameworks 5</application>&quot; você usa "
"depende somente de onde o link simbólico aponta. Nenhuma outra "
"reconfiguração será necessária."

